---
// The first screen: the promise, the mascot and the Home screen.
---

<section
  class="wrap grid min-h-[520px] grid-cols-[1.1fr_.8fr_1.1fr] items-center gap-4 pt-10 pb-8 max-lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr_1fr] max-md:grid-cols-2 max-md:gap-6 max-sm:flex max-sm:flex-col max-sm:pt-7"
  id="top"
  aria-labelledby="hero-title"
>
  <div class="hero-copy max-md:col-span-full max-md:text-center">
    <p class="pill">Free software · Linux, macOS, Windows</p>
    <h1 class="mt-6 mb-4 text-[clamp(38px,4.2vw,62px)] font-[850] max-sm:text-[40px]" id="hero-title">
      All your games.
      <br />
      <span class="accent-text">One launcher.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="my-[1em] max-w-[520px] text-lead text-muted max-md:mx-auto">
      Marah Launcher is a game launcher for a TV and a controller. It puts your games from emulators, PC folders and
      Steam in one library, and you play them from the couch.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3.5 max-md:justify-center">
      <a class="cta" href="#get">
        Get Marah Launcher
      </a>
      <a class="btn-outline" href="https://github.com/MarahHQ/marah-launcher">
        View on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mascot-wrap relative flex items-center justify-center">
    <div
      class="mascot-glow absolute inset-[18%] rounded-full bg-[rgba(76,139,220,.45)] blur-[60px]"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>
    <img
      class="mascot relative w-[115%] max-w-[440px] drop-shadow-[0_10px_22px_rgba(130,216,245,.3)] max-sm:w-[80%]"
      src="assets/mascot.webp"
      fetchpriority="high"
      alt="The Marah mascot: a smiling gamepad that winks and gives a thumbs up"
      width="720"
      height="720"
    />
  </div>
  <figure class="preview perspective-[1000px]">
    <div class="preview-frame [transform:rotate(-3deg)_rotateY(-5deg)] overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border-3 border-ice border-r-blue bg-bg shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(130,216,245,.45),0_0_48px_rgba(76,139,220,.3)] max-md:[transform:none]">
      <img
        src="assets/screen-home.webp"
        alt="The Marah Launcher home screen: a list of game sources on the right, with All games, Steam, PC, Nintendo Switch and PlayStation 5"
        width="1600"
        height="900"
        decoding="async"
        class="block"
      />
    </div>
    <figcaption class="mt-3.5 text-center text-caption text-muted">The home screen, Default theme.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
